  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, numbers are $1,2,3 \\ldots \\ldots .20$ Here, number of ways of selecting four consecutive numbers $=17$\r\n$\\because$ Required number of selecting 4 non-consecutive\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n\\text { numbers } &={ }^{20} C_{4}-17 \\\\\r\n&=\\frac{20 \\times 19 \\times 18 \\times 17}{4 \\times 3 \\times 2 \\times 1}-17 \\\\\r\n&=285 \\times 17-17 \\\\\r\n=& 284 \\times 17\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$",
